
Description:

A Mailbox created through JMAP Mailbox/set without a sortOrder gets
the RFC mandated value: 0.

Mailboxes created by non-JMAP (e.g. IMAP) still get 10, to sort after
role mailboxes.


Documentation:

None.  The behaviour follows RFC 8621 as written.


